FROM rust:1.99.1-slim-bookworm@sha256:f2c004e3d2d8b547e8cf7ffbc29205385f4e71d23e53e4e383065db5e9f822cd
RUN apt-get update \
    && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends build-essential gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu libc6-dev-arm64-cross cmake perl pkg-config libfontconfig1 ca-certificates \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* \
    && rustup target add aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu
RUN dpkg --add-architecture arm64 \
    && apt-get update \
    && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends libfontconfig1-dev:amd64 libfontconfig1-dev:arm64 \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
ENV CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=1 CARGO_PROFILE_DEV_DEBUG=0 \
    CARGO_BUILD_TARGET=aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu \
    CARGO_TARGET_AARCH64_UNKNOWN_LINUX_GNU_LINKER=aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc \
    CC_aarch64_unknown_linux_gnu=aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc \
    AR_aarch64_unknown_linux_gnu=aarch64-linux-gnu-ar \
    PKG_CONFIG_ALLOW_CROSS=1 \
    PKG_CONFIG_LIBDIR_aarch64_unknown_linux_gnu=/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/pkgconfig:/usr/share/pkgconfig
WORKDIR /workspace
